      "passed": 4,
      "failed": 2
    },
    "minimalFix": "Use MAX_TEXT_BYTES for both initial open and content capture.",
    "v2": "Removed injectable production capture closure after first green; deterministic growth/counter behavior is now wholly in tests around the actual bounded open and existing production capture. Original red and first green receipts remain unchanged."
  },
